WEBVTT

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.530
I'm very tired, maro...

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:03.973
I thought I was taking a fishing trip
outside the city, but...

00:02:04.233 --> 00:02:08.003
I'm going fishing too, maro.
We'll all go together, maro!

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:11.133
We'll all go together, maro.
We'll go fishing, maro.

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:11.826
Maro!

00:02:15.533 --> 00:02:17.633
Nobody is coming with me, maro...

00:02:19.066 --> 00:02:21.966
Actually, where is this place, maro?!

00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:24.873
I'm going back to town, maro.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.330
I'll search for the others, maro...

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:28.233
Not here... nor there...

00:02:28.766 --> 00:02:30.896
No matter where I look,
there's no one around, maro!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.830
Which way is the town, maro?!

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:35.833
Maro, maro, maro, maro, maro!

00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:45.473
I believe this is what
they call "being lost," maro!

00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:50.733
DEAR SHADOW

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.170
Maro...

00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:54.326
Maro...

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:57.503
I can't walk anymore, maro.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:02:59.903
Saber Tiger...

00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:05.333
Help me out, maro.

00:03:05.633 --> 00:03:06.803
Leave it to me.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.500
I'm so sleepy, maro...

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:16.700
What's wrong, maro?

00:03:17.866 --> 00:03:18.526
That's...

00:03:29.833 --> 00:03:33.533
It looks like an inn.
Let's stay here for the night.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.030
We couldn't find anyone, maro.

00:03:37.266 --> 00:03:39.366
We'll find them tomorrow for sure.

00:03:42.766 --> 00:03:44.396
They're looking for us!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.230
That Shadow looks strong.

00:03:46.566 --> 00:03:48.066
We'll let them stay
so we can defeat them.

00:03:48.366 --> 00:03:49.566
Saber Tiger!

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:50.703
Roger.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.270
Yes?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.900
I would like to stay the night, maro.

00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:08.073
Yes, of course.
Please come inside.

00:04:08.366 --> 00:04:09.926
Thank you, maro.

00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:14.666
Would you like to have a meal?

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:15.933
Is that possible, maro?

00:04:16.266 --> 00:04:17.696
If you don't mind leftovers.

00:04:18.033 --> 00:04:19.603
That'll be fine, maro.

00:04:20.166 --> 00:04:23.026
When your meal is ready,
I'll ring this bell.

00:04:24.466 --> 00:04:26.996
Your room is the corner room on
the second floor, at the end of the hall.

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.203
Got it, maro.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.530
Please use this stairway.

00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:32.133
Thank you, maro.

00:04:39.166 --> 00:04:42.566
This is heaven, maro!

00:04:42.866 --> 00:04:43.526
Marumaro...

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.900
Why don't you take a shower?

00:04:46.433 --> 00:04:48.173
Since when did you become
my mother?!

00:04:48.366 --> 00:04:50.096
Please take a shower.

00:04:50.133 --> 00:04:51.403
Why, maro?!

00:04:51.433 --> 00:04:53.603
Put yourself in my place...

00:04:53.633 --> 00:04:55.603
being the Shadow of a muddy,
smelly body!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.700
What are you a neat freak, maro?

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:03.173
Yes, actually. Excuse me!

00:05:03.233 --> 00:05:06.733
What are you doing, maro?!
You can't do that, maro!

00:05:06.766 --> 00:05:08.396
D-Don't touch!

00:05:09.733 --> 00:05:11.533
I'll c-catch a cold.

00:05:11.566 --> 00:05:12.566
Here we go.

00:05:17.733 --> 00:05:19.873
Aw, that tickles, maro.

00:05:20.466 --> 00:05:23.096
- I got soap in my eyes, maro.
- Hold still for a minute, please.

00:05:25.166 --> 00:05:28.696
Ah, that feels great!

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.330
Something smells delicious, maro!

00:05:35.533 --> 00:05:37.003
I can't wait anymore, maro.

00:05:38.866 --> 00:05:41.666
- Y-You're showing...! Marumaro!
- What are they cooking, maro?

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.370
U-Use your t-t-towel!

00:05:43.766 --> 00:05:45.326
I want to peek what
they're cooking, maro.

00:05:45.666 --> 00:05:47.066
You shouldn't peek!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.170
Huh?

00:06:00.166 --> 00:06:02.226
Ah! Who is that woman?

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.930
Maybe the wife of the innkeeper?

00:06:05.066 --> 00:06:08.096
I never dreamed the wife of
that innkeeper would be so pretty...

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.200
Maro! Maro!

00:06:10.233 --> 00:06:11.833
What are you getting frisky about?!

00:06:12.266 --> 00:06:14.396
Don't tell me you like her?!

00:06:16.533 --> 00:06:18.433
Frisky, maro!

00:06:20.366 --> 00:06:22.366
What are you doing?!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.600
Maro maro maro maro
maro maro maro...

00:06:28.533 --> 00:06:31.233
I'd love to do all sorts of
things with her.

00:06:31.266 --> 00:06:33.196
Ah, maro!

00:06:33.233 --> 00:06:35.173
What are you thinking?!
She's someone else's wife!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.470
Knock it off.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.770
Maro!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.270
Hurry up and get dressed!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.170
I've finally calmed down, maro.

00:06:47.866 --> 00:06:50.626
I told you that was
stomach medicine, didn't I?

00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:52.266
There's no reason to throw dishes!

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.300
Shut up!

00:06:58.366 --> 00:06:59.366
What's going on, maro?!

00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:02.603
Huh? What happened to
your wife, maro?

00:07:02.666 --> 00:07:03.326
My wife?

00:07:04.066 --> 00:07:05.896
There was a pretty lady
here before, maro.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.630
There's no such person.
I'm single.

00:07:09.866 --> 00:07:13.296
But I heard a couple arguing.
And what about all this?!

00:07:13.533 --> 00:07:18.233
I slipped and broke some dishes
by accident.

00:07:23.966 --> 00:07:25.526
There's something suspicious
about him.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.200
You think so too, maro?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:33.800
Yes, there must be some reason why he's
hiding about his wife, or about that lady.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.330
If he didn't want us to know
about that lady,

00:07:36.366 --> 00:07:38.566
he could've just refused to
put us up, maro.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.000
True...

00:07:43.266 --> 00:07:45.226
Here's the poison, dear.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.400
Got it.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.430
Coming!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.900
Sorry to have kept you waiting.
Right this way.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:06.030
Yay, maro!

00:08:08.633 --> 00:08:10.533
This looks good, maro!

00:08:10.633 --> 00:08:12.103
Chow time, maro!

00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:14.903
If you need anything,
I'll be in the next room.

00:08:22.066 --> 00:08:23.166
It went as planned.

00:08:23.533 --> 00:08:24.203
Yes.

00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:31.026
For a second, I thought
he was going to catch on.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.200
He's dead.

00:08:40.366 --> 00:08:42.096
His Shadow looked really powerful.

00:08:42.133 --> 00:08:43.573
This was our only choice.

00:08:43.866 --> 00:08:46.526
I never thought that somebody
from Grankingdom

00:08:46.566 --> 00:08:48.466
would track us all
the way out here!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.330
We'd finally found someplace
where we could be happy.

00:08:51.866 --> 00:08:52.526
Yeah.

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:56.696
We'll not have it destroyed by
a Shadow Wielder from Grankingdom!

00:10:27.033 --> 00:10:28.573
I can't take this anymore!

00:10:38.066 --> 00:10:40.966
He's deserting! Get him!
Execute him!

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.200
Follow him!
Don't let him get away!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.930
- Dear!
- My love!

00:12:07.966 --> 00:12:09.596
Too bad...

00:12:12.366 --> 00:12:15.526
I'm not a Shadow Wielder from
the Grankingdom, maro.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:19.100
We are wanted by Grankingodm too.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:23.500
- H-He's alive!
- H-He's alive!

00:12:36.833 --> 00:12:38.033
How?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.230
I have a very sensitive nose, maro.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.670
I could tell that there was something
in this food that I shouldn't eat, maro.

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:46.630
So that's why you didn't eat it.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.200
I'm sorry!

00:12:48.433 --> 00:12:52.133
We were certain you were from
Grankingdom coming after us.

00:12:52.666 --> 00:12:54.826
But I'm really glad that
you're all right.

00:12:56.566 --> 00:12:57.226
It's another guest...

00:12:57.633 --> 00:12:58.773
Wait a minute, maro.

00:13:03.833 --> 00:13:06.573
Marumaro, we should avoid
getting into a fight here.

00:13:06.966 --> 00:13:08.096
I know that, maro.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.700
Same here.

00:13:09.966 --> 00:13:10.626
Yeah.

00:13:14.366 --> 00:13:15.796
Anyone there?!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.730
Hi, welcome.
How many in your party?

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.430
All that you see.

00:13:21.866 --> 00:13:24.296
We would like you to provide us
a meal and a place to sleep.

00:13:24.533 --> 00:13:26.703
Y-Yes, of course.

00:13:27.266 --> 00:13:29.096
Pat and Conners,
you stand guard.

00:13:30.133 --> 00:13:30.803
- Roger.
- Roger.

00:13:31.366 --> 00:13:33.326
Sorry, fellows.
I will send your relief soon.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.370
The rest of you, inside.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:36.300
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

00:13:37.433 --> 00:13:39.303
Get some rest in your room first.

00:13:39.533 --> 00:13:41.333
I'll let you know when
the food's ready.

00:13:41.766 --> 00:13:42.426
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

00:13:43.766 --> 00:13:45.566
Uh... Captain, sir?

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.470
What is it?!

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:50.230
What are you doing out in
this remote region?

00:13:50.833 --> 00:13:52.803
We are hunting for
enemy Shadow Wielders.

00:13:53.166 --> 00:13:54.396
What?!

00:13:54.866 --> 00:13:59.126
You're hunting for
enemy Shadow Wielders, you say?

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:00.630
Maro!

00:14:00.666 --> 00:14:02.596
What's that?
Is someone else here?

00:14:02.733 --> 00:14:05.003
Ah, well, it's just an employee.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.070
Oh?

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:08.430
This is bad, maro...
I know what I'll do, maro!

00:14:09.466 --> 00:14:10.866
This'll do, maro!

00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:13.703
What? The dinner is ready already?

00:14:13.733 --> 00:14:14.733
Ah, well, that's...

00:14:15.766 --> 00:14:18.066
I was just getting hungry.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.330
You mustn't eat that, maro!

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:23.500
You eat that and there's gonna
be big trouble, maro!

00:14:23.566 --> 00:14:25.326
"There's going to be trouble, maro"?!

00:14:25.966 --> 00:14:28.026
I've heard that odd way of
ending sentences somewhere before...

00:14:28.266 --> 00:14:29.926
There's going to be trouble, maru.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.200
Maru?

00:14:31.766 --> 00:14:33.766
Hey, you! Say something...maru!

00:14:34.766 --> 00:14:36.626
Do you really talk like
that to your employer?!

00:14:36.666 --> 00:14:39.296
Uh... You say something, maru!

00:14:39.433 --> 00:14:41.433
This food has gone cold.

00:14:41.566 --> 00:14:45.526
I'll bring some food right away,
so please wait in your room.

00:14:45.866 --> 00:14:47.226
Hmm...

00:14:51.666 --> 00:14:54.726
We should just let him eat
this poisoned food.

00:14:54.933 --> 00:14:57.233
If we do that,
then there'll be a big fuss.

00:14:57.266 --> 00:15:00.466
They would find out who I am,
and who you are as well!

00:15:00.766 --> 00:15:03.466
That's true. You're pretty smart.

00:15:03.666 --> 00:15:04.926
Smarter than you for sure.

00:15:05.366 --> 00:15:06.696
What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:06.833 --> 00:15:09.103
This is no time for an argument.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:10.770
Right...

00:15:11.166 --> 00:15:13.666
Let's just feed them
so they'll go to sleep, maro!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.100
Right!

00:15:16.466 --> 00:15:18.326
Come on, hurry, maro!

00:15:18.366 --> 00:15:20.996
Marumaro, watch your step.

00:15:28.966 --> 00:15:30.696
Wow! This looks delicious!

00:15:30.733 --> 00:15:32.433
Please enjoy while it's still hot.

00:15:32.733 --> 00:15:33.873
You may eat!

00:15:34.366 --> 00:15:35.026
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:15:42.933 --> 00:15:43.973
Please take your time.

00:15:55.066 --> 00:15:56.366
How did it go, maro?

00:15:56.766 --> 00:15:58.066
They seem to be enjoying the food.

00:15:58.533 --> 00:15:59.903
We'll take care of the rest.

00:16:00.433 --> 00:16:03.373
The soldiers are using all of
the rooms on the second floor,

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.970
so we're gonna have to put you
up in that room over there.

00:16:05.233 --> 00:16:06.773
We'll call you if anything happens.

00:16:08.633 --> 00:16:12.303
Guess that innkeeper just might
turn out to be a good guy, maro.

00:16:12.466 --> 00:16:14.066
I think so, too.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:22.300
I'm tired, maro.
I'm getting sleepy, maro.

00:16:30.933 --> 00:16:31.603
Hey.

00:16:33.433 --> 00:16:34.103
What is it?

00:16:34.833 --> 00:16:38.073
There's a reward for
that Marumaro kid.

00:16:38.266 --> 00:16:38.926
What?

00:16:39.333 --> 00:16:42.473
I just saw the wanted posters while
those soldiers were eating.

00:16:42.833 --> 00:16:44.433
How big a bounty are
we talking about?

00:16:44.866 --> 00:16:46.296
A very large amount of money.

00:16:46.333 --> 00:16:47.433
Really?

00:16:47.566 --> 00:16:48.566
Really.

00:16:48.633 --> 00:16:49.833
Let's turn him in.

00:16:50.866 --> 00:16:53.596
But if we do that, they'll find out
about us, too.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.700
We'll be fine. We just run away after
they give us the money.

00:16:56.866 --> 00:16:57.866
What about this inn?

00:16:57.966 --> 00:17:00.466
We'll just buy another one
somewhere else.

00:17:00.866 --> 00:17:05.766
We're going to need
some savings for our future.

00:17:07.533 --> 00:17:08.203
You're right!

00:17:10.766 --> 00:17:12.296
Oh, are they already asleep?

00:17:14.866 --> 00:17:16.596
Huh? That's...

00:17:17.166 --> 00:17:20.226
It's the wanted posters.
I guess the captain forgot them.

00:17:21.066 --> 00:17:21.726
Let me see.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.570
You're in here, too!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.970
What theâ€”! Look at that face!
It doesn't look anything like me!

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.900
What's going on?!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.400
What?! What happened?!

00:17:46.666 --> 00:17:48.366
Are you the one who
had this sketch drawn?!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.870
Don't you think it's a little rude?!

00:17:50.033 --> 00:17:52.733
Couldn't you use
a more flattering drawing?!

00:17:52.766 --> 00:17:53.766
I...can't breathe.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.870
C-Cut it out...

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.200
E-Enemy attack!

00:17:57.633 --> 00:17:58.303
Maro?!

00:17:59.566 --> 00:18:00.296
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:18:00.766 --> 00:18:01.766
Th-This is bad.

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:03.900
Sorry, I guess it wasn't such
a good idea...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.170
R-Run!

00:18:05.233 --> 00:18:08.703
Don't let them get away!
After them! After them!

00:18:08.733 --> 00:18:09.403
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:10.370
Maro!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.370
What happened, maro?
What's all the fuss about, maro?

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:20.100
I'm sorry. We were going to sell
you to Grankingdom...

00:18:20.133 --> 00:18:23.803
No, it's not his fault. It was mine.

00:18:24.033 --> 00:18:26.503
I told him that we should do it.

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:37.770
I won't let you get away! Fire!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.000
No! Please don't shoot them!

00:18:44.433 --> 00:18:45.603
Honey!

00:18:46.266 --> 00:18:46.926
Are you all right?!

00:18:47.666 --> 00:18:50.626
Don't worry, dear.
It's just a scratch.

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:53.700
No more fooling around!
We won't miss again!

00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:54.973
Be prepared!

00:18:56.366 --> 00:18:58.496
I can't allow that, maro!

00:18:58.866 --> 00:19:01.426
Saber Tiger!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.500
What? You're...!

00:19:20.033 --> 00:19:21.933
You're the Shadow Wielder
from the wanted poster!

00:19:21.966 --> 00:19:23.766
You're just figuring this out now, maro?!

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:27.330
I'm flabbergasted that it took
you so long, maro!

00:19:27.366 --> 00:19:29.726
Take aim! Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:19:36.166 --> 00:19:37.326
You guys are not much
of a challenge.

00:19:37.466 --> 00:19:38.926
I'm getting bored here!

00:19:39.033 --> 00:19:40.973
Then how about this?!

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:42.900
Robo soldiers!

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.830
Shoot!

00:20:01.366 --> 00:20:03.526
Take this! And this!

00:20:04.833 --> 00:20:05.503
Here!

00:20:15.166 --> 00:20:17.326
You're the only one left, maro!

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.630
H-Help!

00:20:22.633 --> 00:20:25.603
H-Help me!

00:20:33.166 --> 00:20:36.566
I'm sorry, Marumaro.
Do with us what you will.

00:20:38.033 --> 00:20:39.373
Don't worry about it, maro.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:40.570
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

00:20:41.033 --> 00:20:41.703
Huh?

00:20:42.233 --> 00:20:43.433
I'm for justice.

00:20:43.466 --> 00:20:44.466
And...

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.670
I'd really hate to see such
a beautiful woman get hurt, maro.

00:20:53.633 --> 00:20:54.303
Dear...

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.170
Honey...

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.870
- I love you!
- I love you!

00:20:59.366 --> 00:21:01.096
So everything worked out, maro.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:05.530
But we won't be able to operate
the inn here for a while like this...

00:21:06.233 --> 00:21:07.233
It's gonna be all right!

00:21:07.833 --> 00:21:09.933
We can build a new inn
somewhere else.

00:21:10.366 --> 00:21:12.066
We can do it if we work together!

00:21:12.266 --> 00:21:13.426
Yeah! You're right!

00:21:13.633 --> 00:21:17.173
But still, Grankingdom soldiers
might come back again, maro.

00:21:17.266 --> 00:21:19.026
You should leave soon, maro.

00:21:19.933 --> 00:21:20.603
Yes...

00:21:21.166 --> 00:21:21.826
Marumaro...

00:21:23.333 --> 00:21:24.873
I'm sorry about everything.

00:21:25.866 --> 00:21:26.526
Thank you.

00:21:28.533 --> 00:21:30.133
Good-bye!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.330
Take care!

00:21:36.033 --> 00:21:39.333
It's amazing that Marumaro
didn't try to touch that lady.

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:43.570
Marumaro may actually
be a gentleman.

00:21:46.233 --> 00:21:47.873
Marumaro!

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.400
Ah! That voice is...!

00:21:49.566 --> 00:21:51.266
Ah, it's Marumaro!

00:21:51.566 --> 00:21:52.566
Marumaro!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.200
- Marumaro!
- Hey!

00:21:54.366 --> 00:21:55.866
Everyone!

00:21:57.233 --> 00:21:58.503
Marumaro!

00:21:58.900 --> 00:21:59.900
We're so glad you're safe.

00:21:59.933 --> 00:22:01.573
We were so worried about you.

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:02.830
Are you okay?

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:06.130
I'm really glad we found you!

00:22:06.466 --> 00:22:07.126
Yeah!

00:22:12.133 --> 00:22:14.103
I guess some things
never change.

00:22:14.866 --> 00:22:16.296
I'm out of here.

00:22:16.333 --> 00:22:19.873
Cut it out! Get away!

00:22:20.466 --> 00:22:22.596
I'm commemorating
our reunion, maro!

00:22:22.633 --> 00:22:24.973
It's just an expression
of my affection, maro!

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:23.800
Shu and the others investigate
the mystery of the ruins,

00:24:23.833 --> 00:24:26.573
but they find it far more boring
than expected.

00:24:27.400 --> 00:24:29.330
Have you heard any
interesting stories lately?

00:24:29.366 --> 00:24:32.896
All the recent ones seem
to end with tooth polishing, maro.

00:24:32.933 --> 00:24:34.903
You must be referring to
the Toothbrush Prince.

00:24:34.933 --> 00:24:36.603
Wait, it's not the Tissue Prince?

00:24:36.833 --> 00:24:37.873
It's a mystery, maro.

00:24:38.100 --> 00:24:40.470
Next on Blue Dragon:
"The Mystery of the Ruins"
